<title>USA: BOXING-BOWE BEATS GOLOTA ON ANOTHER DISQUALIFICATION.</title>
<headline>BOXING-BOWE BEATS GOLOTA ON ANOTHER DISQUALIFICATION.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTIC CITY 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the second time in five months former heavyweight champion Riddick Bowe won a fight from Andrew Golota Saturday on a disqualification.</p>
<p>The Pole had points deducted for a head butt and two low blows, and the referee stopped the bout in the ninth round of their scheduled 10-round bout.</p>
</text>
